Changes
-------
  - The music player is gone: MusicKit, audio, HLS, lyrics, playback
    controls, Apple Music and Last.fm sign-in and the network preconnects
    were removed. The pages show the launcher's games, ports and library
    instead, from the launcher's /v1 API (../api.js).
  - All Cider names, logos and icons were removed from the visible UI; the
    page is branded y4bo. Settings > About links back to Cider.
  - The Google Fonts imports in style.less were removed (the page is
    offline); the menu button uses assets/hamborgar.svg.
  - The LESS is precompiled to cider.css instead of compiled at runtime.
  - New files: app/launcher.js, launcher.less.

